+/// The crash search's structural guess, instrumented for the bench and the kick replay: how often
+/// the verified window answered (fires), how often it missed and the bisection ran (fallbacks),
+/// and the readouts the window spent. Counters only; never an outcome.
+pub static IMPACT_GUESS_FIRES: AtomicU64 = AtomicU64::new(0);
+pub static IMPACT_GUESS_FALLBACKS: AtomicU64 = AtomicU64::new(0);
